igh-contrast graphic of a bedroom clock glowing \\\"03:00 AM\\\" to represent nighttime wakefulness, while the right half features a crisp studio product shot of the dual-toned blue and white Melts container with a single, translucent caramel-brown strip floating elegantly above it. The on-image headline is \\\"Fall Asleep in Minutes, Guaranteed.\\\" This layout uses under 20 percent text to ensure maximum visual impact. The copy highlights a limited-time buy-one-get-one-free offer and a 30-day risk-free guarantee to drive immediate bottom-of-funnel conversion. The call to action is a sharp, zero-radius button in Action Orange (#ff5000) that reads \\\"Shop Risk-Free Now\\\". To keep the ad on-brand, use Circular Std for the headline, Outfit for the supporting text, and keep the tone clinical yet deeply comforting.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This product consists of a pocket-sized, vertically oriented rectangular container with highly rounded corners containing individual, ultra-thin oral dissolving strips. The flat-fronted container features a dual-toned color scheme where the upper half is a solid medium blue and the lower half is solid white, divided by a soft, wavy light-blue gradient band. In the upper-left corner of the container's front is a white circular logo featuring the text \\\"WELLBEING NUTRITION\\\" wrapped around a stylized central \\\"W,\\\" while the top right displays the text \\\"30 Oral Thin Strips\\\" next to a small, white peeled-strip icon. Centered in the blue upper section is a graphic of a white crescent moon partially behind a dark blue cloud, accented by small white stars. Below this, the product name \\\"melts® into a restful sleep\\\" is printed in white, with the words \\\"restful\\\" and \\\"sleep\\\" encased in two separate, dark-blue rectangular blocks. The lower white section displays the blue text \\\"Melatonin - 10mg\\\" above a short black-text product description, followed by \\\"Lemon Honey Flavour\\\" next to a small yellow and