ry gummies by highlighting the superior delivery system. The visual hero is the innovative oral thin strip format itself. Set against a warm Sand Beige (#F4EBE1) background, the ad features a clean, high-fashion comparison grid: on the left, a crossed-out, clinical-looking pile of chalky white pills labeled \\\"Bulky & Slow,\\\" and on the right, a vibrant shot of the pocket-sized blue-and-white Melts container with a semi-translucent caramel-brown strip labeled \\\"Fast-Acting & Zero Sugar.\\\" The short on-image headline is \\\"Ditch the Pills. Melt Into Sleep.\\\" To drive immediate purchase action, the ad prominently displays a \\\"Save 20% Today\\\" first-purchase discount to remove price friction. The single call to action is a high-contrast, linear gradient button (#ff9000 to #ff5000) with a zero-border-radius reading \\\"Claim 20% Off\\\". Maintain brand integrity by rendering the headline in Circular Std, utilizing a subtle grid overlay with 0.1 opacity for a premium feel, and keeping the visual style airy, clean, and highly sophisticated.\",\"prompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Using the Side-by-Side Comparison framework, this ad targets consumers tired of swallowing bulky sleep pills or chewing sugary gummies by highlighting the superior delivery system. The visual hero is the innovative oral thin strip format itself. Set against a warm Sand Beige (#F4EBE1) background, the ad features a clean, high-fashion comparison grid: on the left, a crossed-out, clinical-looking pile of chalky white pills labeled \\\"Bulky & Slow,\\\" and on the right, a vibrant shot of the pocket-sized blue-and-white Melts container with a semi-translucent caramel-brown strip labeled \\\"Fast-Acting & Zero Sugar.\\\" The short on-image headline is \\\"Ditch the Pills. Melt Into Sleep.\\\" To drive immediate purchase action, the ad prominently displays a \\\"Save 20% Today\\\" first-purchase discount to remove price friction. The single call to action is a high-contrast, linear 